## Random Variation

---

 $$\ell =  \mu_p C_{ox} \frac{W}{L}$$

 $$ I_D = \frac{1}{2} \ell (V_{GS} - V_{tp})^2$$

 Due to doping , length, width, $$C_{ox}$$, $$V_{tp}$$, ... random varation

 $$\ell_1 \ne \ell_2$$

